    👎 ➡️ 🖍🆕named
    ↪️ ⁉️ variable 🔤GRAPEVINE_CONFIG🔤❗️ ➡️ chosen 🍇
      ↪️ 📐 chosen❗️ ▶️ 0 🍇
        chosen ➡️ 🖍path
        👍 ➡️ 🖍named
      🍉
    🍉
    📄🐇🧺 settings path ⁉️ file path❗️ named❗️

    ↪️ ⁉️ variable 🔤PORT🔤❗️ ➡️ port 🍇
      ↪️ 📐 port❗️ ▶️ 0 🍇
        🏷 settings 🔤PORT🔤❗️
        🎚🔸🔡 settings 🔤server.port🔤 port❗️
      🍉
    🍉

    🔂 key 🐙 settings❗️ 🍇
      🌳🐇🧺 key❗️ ➡️ name
